      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Chosen over schema-per-tenant: one migration, one connection pool.\nThe isolation test proves Org A cannot reach Org B on every\ntenant-owned endpoint.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
