      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789900000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "a0263",
      "text": "SameSite=None + Secure.  Lax is not sent on a cross-site XHR, so login would appear to succeed and every\nrequest after it would 401. Both derive from one COOKIE_SECURE flag, which makes the invalid combination\nunrepresentable.\n\nproxy_buffering off.  A buffered proxy holds the whole SSE stream and delivers it at the end, which looks\nexactly like a pipeline that produced nothing for nine seconds.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SameSite=None + Secure.  Lax is not sent on a cross-site XHR, so login would appear to succeed and every\nrequest after it would 401. Both derive from one COOKIE_SECURE flag, which makes the invalid combination\nunrepresentable.\n\nproxy_buffering off.  A buffered proxy holds the whole SSE stream and delivers it at the end, which looks\nexactly like a pipeline that produced nothing for nine seconds.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
